==English==

===Etymology===
Dating from the seventeenth century; related to {{term|slattering||slovenly}}, from the [[dialectal]] verb {{term|slatter||to slop, to spill}}.<ref name="COED-etym&def">The '''Concise Oxford English Dictionary''' [Eleventh Edition]</ref>

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|/ˈslætɜːn/}}
*: {{rhymes|ætə(r)n}}
*{{hyphenation|slat|tern}}<ref name="M–W-hyph&def">“[http://www.m-w.com/dictionary/slattern slattern]” is listed in '''Merriam–Webster’s Online Dictionary'''</ref>

